At eight o'clock, I set off.
I lock the flat.
It is very cold today.
I am only wearing my jacket.
I walk quickly to the U-Bahn.
I am almost at the station.
Then I hear the train.
I run into the station.
The U-Bahn is already standing at the platform.
I run quickly to the doors.
But unfortunately I am too late.
The doors close.
The train departs immediately.
I sigh quietly.
That is really bad luck.
I look at my mobile phone.
The next U-Bahn comes in ten minutes.
So I wait at the platform.
I am a little cold in my jacket.
But ten minutes are not long.
